Corvane's own source code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see
LICENSE). Every graphic, font, 3D model, sound effect and piece of music is
generated by code in this repository (see ASSETS.md); no third-party assets
are used.

The ROM is built with BlocksDS. The components below end up inside every
Corvane ROM. This file and the full licence texts in licenses/ are also
copied into the ROM's file system (NitroFS: /licenses/) and can be read in
the game: Title > Credits > X (licence viewer).

Components that are NOT included: Corvane runs its own ARM7 core instead of
the BlocksDS default ARM7 binary, so DSWiFi, lwIP, Mbed TLS, Maxmod and
LibXM7 are not linked into the ROM.

