5. Build-time tools (not part of the ROM)
-----------------------------------------
The BlocksDS toolchain (GCC, binutils, ndstool, ...) and Python 3 run only
during the build inside the pinned Docker image and do not end up in the ROM.


Adding a library
----------------
When a new library is linked into the ROM, append its notice here, copy its
licence text into licenses/, and add a line to the in-game credits
(arm9/source/game/scenes.c).
